.pkginfo

    pkgversion=2 is required.

    name= is the name of package.
    version= is the version of package.
    arch= is the required architecture of the machine.
        - any or nothing        For any machine
        - x86_64                AMD 64 bit architecture
        - i386                  Intel x86 architecture
        - aarch64               ARM 64 bit architecture
        - armv7l                ARM 32 bit architecture
    os= is the required OS of the machine.
        - any or nothing        For any OS
        - linux                 Linux
        - macos                 macOS (Darwin)
        - freebsd               FreeBSD

    example:

    pkgversion=2
    name=foo
    version=1.2
    arch=x86_64
    os=linux

Example
    . package
        bin/
            foo
        lib/
        .pkginfo
